#: data/scripts/fusion.inc:267
msgctxt "Fusion_Text_CaptureModeHelp"
msgid ""
"Convenient: wild Pokémon are 2x easier.\n"
"Material: every Pokémon is always caught.$"
msgstr ""
"便捷：野生宝可梦的捕获率翻倍。\n"
"材料：所有宝可梦都必定捕获。$"

#: data/scripts/fusion.inc:271
msgctxt "Fusion_Text_TerminalIntro"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Fusion Terminal!\p"
"Fuse: combine two Pokémon from your\n"
"party or any Box into a new one.\p"
"The child takes moves, IVs, its main\n"
"ability and passives from both.\l"
"Both parents are used up.\p"
"Appraise: see IVs, passives and types.\n"
"Settings: capture mode, Exp. Share.\p"
"Tip: wild Pokémon sometimes carry\n"
"passives or a third type. Catch them!$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎使用炼妖终端！\p"
"炼妖：把队伍或任意盒子里的两只\n"
"宝可梦合成为一只新的宝可梦。\p"
"子代会从双亲继承招式、个体值、\n"
"主特性和被动特性。\l"
"双亲都会被消耗掉。\p"
"鉴定：查看个体值、被动和属性。\n"
"设置：捕获模式、学习装置。\p"
"提示：野生宝可梦有时会带有被动\n"
"或第三属性。快去捕捉吧！$"

