#: data/scripts/fusion.inc:344
msgctxt "Fusion_Text_ReincarnateInfo"
msgid ""
"Reincarnation starts a new adventure\n"
"in a freshly rolled world.\p"
"Your party comes along at Lv. 5 and\n"
"keeps its IVs, moves and genes.\p"
"Shards and your best floor are kept.\n"
"Trainers get stronger every cycle.$"
msgstr ""
"转生后，会在重新随机生成的世界里\n"
"开始一段新的冒险。\p"
"你的队伍会以Lv.5一同前往，\n"
"并保留个体值、招式和基因。\p"
"炼妖碎片和最高层数都会保留。\n"
"每转生一次，训练家都会变得更强。$"

